{"sha": "3901b3f3976388c747e61616f7aff86c67c5da112e5b992ee772a0746832f0ae", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:magnetostatics} 章 --- 磁静力学：场、力与偶极子}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:1}", "$B = \\mu_0I/2\\pi r = 2 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 10/0.01 = \\qty{2e-4}{T}$。若取 \\qty{1}{T}：", "$I = 2\\pi rB/\\mu_0 = \\qty{5e4}{A}$。地磁场所对应的 $r = 2 \\times 10^{-7} \\times", "100/5 \\times 10^{-5} = \\qty{0.4}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:2}", "圆心处：$\\mu_0NI/2R = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 200/0.1 = \\qty{2.5}{mT}$。当 $z = R$ 时：", "$\\times(R^2/2R^2)^{3/2} = 2^{-3/2}$：\\qty{0.89}{mT}。当 $z = 10R$ 时，$\\times(1/101)^{3/2}", "= 10^{-3}$：\\qty{2.5}{\\micro T}，已符合偶极子的 $1/z^3$ 规律。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:3}", "$B = \\mu_0nI = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 1000 \\times 5 = \\qty{6.3}{mT}$；在端点处，", "减半为 \\qty{3.1}{mT}。线径 \\qty{0.5}{mm} 的导线：每米 $2000$ 匝，故", "在 \\qty{5}{A} 时为 \\qty{12.6}{mT}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:4}", "$F = ILB = 10 \\times 1 \\times 0.1 = \\qty{1.0}{N}$；当 \\qty{30}{\\degree} 时，$\\sin30^\\circ$：", "\\qty{0.5}{N}。电动机：$100 \\times \\qty{1}{N} \\times \\qty{0.05}{m} = \\qty{5}{N.m}$ ---", "一台小型工业电动机。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:5}", "令 $z = d\\tan\\alpha$：$B = \\dfrac{\\mu_0I}{4\\pi}\\displaystyle\\int\\dfrac{d\\,\\dd z}{(d^2 + z^2)^{3/2}}", "= \\dfrac{\\mu_0I}{4\\pi d}\\displaystyle\\int_{\\alpha_1}^{\\alpha_2}\\cos\\alpha\\,\\dd\\alpha = \\dfrac{\\mu_0I}{4\\pi d}", "(\\sin\\alpha_2 - \\sin\\alpha_1)$；无限长导线，$\\alpha_{1,2} = \\mp\\pi/2$：$\\mu_0I/2\\pi d$。", "正方形：每边位于 $d = a/2$ 处，所张角为 $\\pm45^\\circ$，给出 $\\mu_0I\\sqrt2/2\\pi a$；", "四边合计：$B = 2\\sqrt2\\,\\mu_0I/\\pi a = 0.90\\,\\mu_0I/a$（作为对比，一个“半径”", "为 $a/2$ 的圆将给出 $\\mu_0I/a$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:6}", "$B(z) = f(z - R/2) + f(z + R/2)$，其中 $f(u) = \\mu_0NIR^2/2(R^2 + u^2)^{3/2}$。", "中点处：$2f(R/2) = \\mu_0NIR^2/(5R^2/4)^{3/2} = (4/5)^{3/2}\\mu_0NI/R$。$f'$ 为", "奇函数，故 $B'(0) = f'(-R/2) + f'(R/2) = 0$；$f''(u) \\propto (4u^2 - R^2)(R^2 +", "u^2)^{-7/2}$ 在 $u = R/2$ 处为零，故 $B''(0) = 2f''(R/2) = 0$，场直至", "三阶均匀。代入数值：$0.716 \\times 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 100/0.15 =", "\\qty{0.60}{mT}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:7}", "表面处：$\\mu_0I/2\\pi a = 2 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 100/0.002 = \\qty{10}{mT}$；在", "\\qty{1}{mm} 处（内部）$\\times r/a$：\\qty{5}{mT}；在 \\qty{1}{cm} 处：\\qty{2}{mT}。$B$ 在", "表面以内线性增大，随后按 $1/r$ 减小。同轴情形下，护套外", "所包围的电流为零，$B = 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:8}", "$2 \\times 10^{-7}$~N/m。母线：$2 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 10^8/0.1 = \\qty{200}{N/m}$；", "在 \\qty{100}{kA} 时：$\\qty{2e4}{N/m}$ --- 每米两吨。开关设备的绝缘", "支撑件按故障电流而非", "正常工作电流来设计。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:9}", "$\\Gamma = mB_h = \\qty{2e-6}{N.m}$；$W = 2mB_h = \\qty{4e-6}{J}$；$J\\ddot\\theta =", "-mB_h\\theta$：$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{J/mB_h} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{10^{-7}/2 \\times 10^{-6}} =", "\\qty{1.4}{s}$。测定振荡周期，由 $B_h = 4\\pi^2J/mT^2$ 求得，前提是 $m$ 与 $J$", "均已知（高斯单独测得 $m$，方法是", "利用它使另一根指针产生的偏转）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:10}", "(a) $\\mu_0IR^2/2z^3 = \\mu_0(I\\pi R^2)/2\\pi z^3 = \\mu_0m/2\\pi z^3 = (\\mu_0/4\\pi)\\,2m/z^3$：", "对应电场中的 $2p/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0z^3$，只需 $1/\\varepsilon_0 \\to \\mu_0$。(b) $m = 2\\pi R_E^3B/", "\\mu_0 = 2\\pi \\times 2.58 \\times 10^{20} \\times 6 \\times 10^{-5}/1.26 \\times 10^{-6} = \\qty{7.7e22}{A.m^2}$。", "(c) $I = m/\\pi R^2 = 7.7 \\times 10^{22}/(\\pi \\times 9 \\times 10^{12}) = \\qty{2.7e9}{A}$。(d)", "赤道处（$\\theta = 90^\\circ$）：$B_\\theta = \\mu_0m/4\\pi R_E^3 = \\qty{3e-5}{T}$，为", "极区值的一半。在 $\\theta = 45^\\circ$ 处：$\\tan(\\text{磁倾角}) = B_r/B_\\theta = 2\\cot\\theta = 2$，", "磁倾角 $= \\qty{63}{\\degree}$ --- 在中纬度，磁场", "陡直地插入地下。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:11}", "$\\mu_0nI = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 2000 \\times 3 = \\qty{7.5}{mT}$。圆心处：$\\tan\\alpha_1 =", "R/(L/2) = 0.2$，$\\cos\\alpha_1 = -\\cos\\alpha_2 = 0.981$：$B = 0.981\\,\\mu_0nI =", "\\qty{7.4}{mT}$（$98\\%$）。端点处：$\\cos\\alpha_1 = 0$，$\\tan\\alpha_2 = R/L$，$\\cos\\alpha_2 =", "-0.995$：$B = 0.497\\,\\mu_0nI = \\qty{3.7}{mT}$（$50\\%$）。在超出端点的 $x$", "处，两端位于同侧：$B = \\tfrac12\\mu_0nI(\\cos\\alpha_1 - \\cos\\alpha_2)", "\\approx \\tfrac12\\mu_0nI\\,\\tfrac{R^2}{2}[1/x^2 - 1/(x + L)^2]$；约为圆心值的 $1\\%$，", "在 $x \\approx \\qty{10}{cm}$ 处，相距约半个长度。$B(z)$ 在", "长度的大部分近似平顶，在两端降为一半，并", "在离端一个长度处降至百分之几。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:magnetostatics:12}", "(a) 绕组自身的场在穿过绕组时由 $0$ 跃变为 $B$；", "作用于其上的场为平均值 $B/2$（薄层不能对", "自身施力）。长 $\\dd l$、宽 $\\dd z$ 的绕组微元所受之力，", "携带电流 $K\\,\\dd z$：$K\\,\\dd z\\,\\dd l\\,B/2$，沿径向向外（可用 $I\\,\\dd\\vect l", "\\wedge\\vect B$ 检验）：压强 $p = KB/2 = B^2/2\\mu_0$，因 $K = nI = B/\\mu_0$。", "(b) \\qty{1}{T}：\\qty{4e5}{Pa} = \\qty{4}{bar}；\\qty{10}{T}：\\qty{400}{bar}；\\qty{45}{T}：", "\\qty{8e8}{Pa} = \\qty{8000}{bar}，接近钢材的 \\qty{1}{GPa}。(c) 绕组", "须承受随 $B^2$ 增长的压强：在约 \\qty{40}{T} 以上", "没有任何材料或冷却方案能够应对 --- 稳态磁体的极限", "在于力学（对于超导体，则是其临界场）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:magnetostatics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 任一包含轴线的平面都是电流分布的", "对称面：$\\vect B$ 垂直于该平面，沿周向；", "由沿轴与绕轴的不变性，$\\vect B = B(r)\\,\\vect e_\\theta$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 半径为 $r$ 的圆周：$2\\pi rB = \\mu_0I_{\\text{包围}}$。芯部：", "$I_{\\text{包围}} = Ir^2/a^2$，$B = \\mu_0Ir/2\\pi a^2$；中间区域：$\\mu_0I/2\\pi r$；", "外部（$r > c$）：$I - I = 0$，$B = 0$。", ""]}